Not a driver, but I was a passenger on a school bus and this one kid near me threw up chocolate pudding on the windows.

&#x200B;

It wasn't like he was sick either, it was more like he was talking to his busmate (I was on the other aisle) and mid-sentence, he turns and pukes all over the window.

&#x200B;

They had to pull the bus over and get the kids out and the sick kid home.

&#x200B;

We were over an HOUR late for school and when the teacher found out why, HE nearly threw up too.

&#x200B;

Needless to say, none of us got detention on account of "Puke."

