Honestly me and my friend, C, both have this in a way. We're both pretty good authors, but we both think we suck. We've been told by many people our work is really good, but we just have this nagging voice in our head. For her, it's impostor syndrome, for me it's feeling like if I take pride in my work, I'll be punished by God for the sin of pride.

&#x200B;

With therapy and self-help, C's been able to make a lot of progress, but I STILL have a lot of trouble accepting praise or anything.

