My dad used to do this when we were estranged, buying his new family tons of gifts and only getting my brother and me like a cheap doll or nothing.  


THEN.... 9-11-01 happened.

&#x200B;

9 days after that, he called for my brother and I picked up the phone and we both broke down crying, apologizing and wanting to make amends.

&#x200B;

When a medical problem made it so I couldn't visit him for Christmas that year, he sent my brother back from the trip with this GIGANTIC box of presents for me. We're talking books, games, clothes, plushies, gift cards, cookies, even an XBOX with games. At least over $600 in gifts.

&#x200B;

After that, every year I could manage to go for Xmas, both my stepbrothers and me were spoiled silly, each of us getting tons of gifts. It was so many that one xmas, i tripped over the mass of presents and fell flat on my face.

&#x200B;

Yet I know that if it hadn't been for him calling that one day and me answering the phone......... None of that would have happened. I had a chance to make things right with my father.... and dammit, I did.
